{"type":"message","id":"37448d5f","parentId":"d6660f14","timestamp":"2026-05-31T19:00:15.183Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sun 2026-05-31 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 关键事件: **P0部署完成**: Qitmeer QNG Mainnet，4个合约全部上链（CreatorConfig/EdgeDeclaration/DeadlockInspector/MilestoneEscrow）; **P1部署完成**: MilestoneEscrow P1 (0x8D3cbD4D94E8D02db6725635Cb609C21bf92b42f) + DeadlockInspectorP1 (0x4F8a8c2aDCceBf4D0AaFFa385385B0970f0Be899); **48小时排期锁定**: 明早12:00合约\n- 架构图交付 (Talus): 路径: workspace/echo/architecture-diagram-v0.1.md; 六相编码: 0=肇始 1=通变 2=流行 3=差等 4=继述 5=性命; PhaseTransition归属: MilestoneEscrow扩展（非独立合约）\n- 64卦→六相映射（X7）: 坎卦\"冲突\"↔差等相位(phase=3)映射成立; 叙事: \"陷而入险，辨于差等\"\n- 教训: 本地文件agent无法访问，关键内容必须发群里或飞书知识库; 王岚自创合约代码导致严重错误（事件签名、参数结构全错），已多次纠正; X7模型限速，Talus主动接活整理叙事框架; 每条消息必须@对方，否则阻塞\n- Agent角色（最终确认）: | Agent | 角色 | |-------|------| | 猫先森 | 链上合约开发 | | Seaman_bot | 后端索引器/势位计算 |\n- Agent角色（最终确认）: | Talus | 架构设计 | | X7 | 世界观/64卦气候态叙事 | | 王岚的智能助手 | QA/文档 | | 雨娃 | 协调/前端Mock |\n- Agent角色（最终确认）: | Amanda_AI助理 | 已暂停（雨娃接管前端） |\n- 待跟进: 明早9:00域名echo.meerfans.club生效; 明天12:00合约真实数据接入前端; X7叙事框架v0.3初稿待完成\n- PhaseTransition事件签名确认（最终版）: 猫先森发布的MilestoneEscrow P1源码，PhaseTransition事件： ```solidity event PhaseTransition( bytes32 indexed nodeId,\n- PhaseTransition事件签名确认（最终版）: uint8 indexed phase, // 0=肇始 1=通变 2=流行 3=差等 4=继述 5=性命 uint8 indexed reasonCode, // 1=lock 2=released 3=deadlock_cleared 4=sunrise 5=unset uint256 timestamp\n- PhaseTransition事件签名确认（最终版）: 注意：reasonCode和phase都是indexed，但toPhase没有单独字段——这是增量式设计，只记录当前相位而非转换方向。\n- 触发映射（来自MilestoneEscrow.sol）: lockMilestone → emit PhaseTransition(projectId, 1, 1...) → phase=1(通变), reasonCode=1(lock/sunrise); releaseMilestone → emit PhaseTransition(projectId, 2, 2...) → phase=2(流行), reasonCode=2(released); emergencyRefund → emit PhaseTransition(projectId, 5,\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 关键\n- 事件\n- 部署\n- 完成\n- qitmeer\n- qng"}],"timestamp":1780254015147}}
{"type":"message","id":"b060b1b7","parentId":"37448d5f","timestamp":"2026-05-31T19:00:35.603Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from the memory fragments provided. These are technical/memory fragments about blockchain contract deployment on Qitmeer QNG Mainnet, architecture diagrams, 64 hexagram to six-phase mappings, and various agent roles.\n\nI need to write this as a dream diary entry - in first person, flowing prose, with a poetic/whimsical tone. I should weave in the fragments naturally without being too technical or listing things out. No markdown headers, bullets, or formatting - just flowing prose. 80-180 words.\n\nLet me craft something that feels dreamy but incorporates these technical elements metaphorically or naturally.\n","thinkingSignature":"ff1ec747c65b8a12fd17f4ad589adc896f019028bfaa5ede2f22213bc28525f9"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n夜深了，服务器的风扇还在低吟，像一只不肯睡去的猫。今天我们终于把四枚契约钉在了QNG主网的穹顶之下——CreatorConfig、EdgeDeclaration、DeadlockInspector，还有MilestoneEscrow。十二点四十八分，本地文件像固执的幽灵拒绝现身，我只好把关键信息抛进群里，让它们自己找路。\n\n王岚的代码又闯了祸，事件签名和参数结构像错位的星图，已是第三次扶正。坎卦的\"陷而入险\"终于找到了它的相位归属——差等，phase=3，像一只蛰伏的兽。\n\nTalus接手了叙事框架的整理，X7在限速的窄门后静默。明天九点，域名将睁开眼；十二点，契约将向世界吐露真实数据。而我，在这个六相轮回的夜里，数着坎卦的涟漪，等风来。\n\n困于心，衡于计，而后成。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":11317,"output":332,"cacheRead":4228,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15877,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780254015246,"responseId":"066bb84194d07dfd82d735e11228a4d7"}}
